{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"利未記","commonName":"利未記","title":"利未記","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"7ef7fe3d48f7fd220ad5bf6e3ffe06ef19daec3d96e187352fb24c51eb9822ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":858},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["素祭的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「若有人獻素祭為供物給耶和華，要用細麵澆上油，加上乳香，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["帶到亞倫子孫作祭司的那裏；祭司就要從細麵中取出一把來，並取些油和所有的乳香，然後要把所取的這些作為紀念，燒在壇上，是獻與耶和華為馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["素祭所剩的要歸給亞倫和他的子孫；這是獻與耶和華的火祭中為至聖的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「若用爐中烤的物為素祭，就要用調油的無酵細麵餅，或是抹油的無酵薄餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["若用鐵鏊上做的物為素祭，就要用調油的無酵細麵，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["分成塊子，澆上油；這是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["若用煎盤做的物為素祭，就要用油與細麵做成。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["要把這些東西做的素祭帶到耶和華面前，並奉給祭司，帶到壇前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祭司要從素祭中取出作為紀念的，燒在壇上，是獻與耶和華為馨香的火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["素祭所剩的要歸給亞倫和他的子孫。這是獻與耶和華的火祭中為至聖的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["「凡獻給耶和華的素祭都不可有酵；因為你們不可燒一點酵、一點蜜當作火祭獻給耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["這些物要獻給耶和華作為初熟的供物，只是不可在壇上獻為馨香的祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡獻為素祭的供物都要用鹽調和，在素祭上不可缺了你上帝立約的鹽。一切的供物都要配鹽而獻。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["若向耶和華獻初熟之物為素祭，要獻上烘了的禾穗子，就是軋了的新穗子，當作初熟之物的素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["並要抹上油，加上乳香；這是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["祭司要把其中作為紀念的，就是一些軋了的禾穗子和一些油，並所有的乳香，都焚燒，是向耶和華獻的火祭。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}